        <mxCell id="6xftwZw5f3BE2wH4BhlQ-95" value="Underlying Structures need to be modifyable to make the recursion possible!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;So the &quot;Build()&quot; is not actually a finite call. The structures are built by initiating empty and then modifying progressively. It just gives the appearance of a functional api" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1">
